      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُغَمَّرٌ</span></b>  A garment, or piece of cloth, <i>dyed with</i>
[<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غُمْرَة</span>, or] <i>saffron.</i> (M, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُغْمَّرَةٌ</span> and
